# Get the persisted RMW DDS XML configuration as a raw string.
---
# Absolute filesystem path of the DDS XML file.
# Empty if the implementation has not yet written or located the file.
string path
# Full contents of the DDS XML file. Empty if the file is missing.
# This is vendor XML (Fast DDS profiles or CycloneDDS), not a TriOrb YAML.
string xml
